title: "Breakpoint: Calibrated Credit Risk and Three-Action Policy"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible credit-risk pipeline that trains a calibrated LightGBM model
  and optimizes a constrained Grow/Hold/Restrict credit-line policy under
  explicit portfolio guardrails.
